column6:
[VOL-I 9.1 p4] Envelope A shall contain, in the following order and separated by numbered dividers:
[VOL-I 9.1(a) p4] (a) Form 4-A — Proposal Submission Letter;
[VOL-I 9.1(b) p4] (b) Form 4-B — Reference Projects Schedule (one per reference project);
[VOL-I 9.1(c) p4] (c) Form 4-C — Conflict of Interest and Debarment Declaration;
[VOL-I 9.1(d) p4] (d) Form 4-D — Parent Company Guarantee (executed);
[VOL-I 9.1(e) p4] (e) Form 4-E — Schedule of Deviations;
[VOL-I 9.1(f) p4] (f) the Technical Proposal narrative;
[VOL-I 9.1(g) p4] (g) the Bid Bond;
[VOL-I 9.1(h) p4] (h) notarised Powers of Attorney for each signatory;
[VOL-I 9.1(i) p4] (i) the certificates and evidence required under Section 8.

